						],
						"pointId": 10624
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401870601,
					"content": "Still working, Ganyu? Sorry it's been so busy.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keqing"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870602,
					"content": "#Huh? Oh, Keqing... No, it's fine, nothing out of the ordinary. {NICKNAME} and Director Hu are the real stars this year.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ganyu"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870603,
					"content": "That's no reason to diminish your own contribution. Of course they were the biggest heroes...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keqing"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870604,
					"content": "But we played our part, and played it well. The Ministry of Civil Affairs responded at record speed, did we not?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keqing"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870605,
					"content": "Even though on the surface, this incident looks negligible compared to the disasters of the Archon War, it was a very close call. Things could have been unimaginably worse had we not found a solution.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keqing"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870606,
					"content": "You're right... Actually, I have a question about the Seven-and-Eight-Gates Method we ended up using. How come I've never seen any records of it in the Yuehai Pavilion before?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ganyu"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870607,
					"content": "Oh, you want to know about the origins of the array? Ningguang made the whole thing up.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keqing"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870608,
					"content": "...Huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ganyu"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870609,
					"content": "Haha. I'm joking.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keqing"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870610,
					"content": "In truth, a letter with all the critical information suddenly appeared in Yujing Terrace on the day when we needed it. Even Yelan was unable to track down where it had come from.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keqing"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870611,
					"content": "Wait... the info just appeared out of thin air? Then... wasn't that a bit of a risky strategy on Ningguang's part...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ganyu"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870612,
					"content": "It may appear that way, but if you think about it carefully, everything slowly starts to make sense...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keqing"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870613,
					"content": "How many people in all of Liyue could know about both the crisis and the secret art, while also possessing the ability to deliver a letter without leaving a trace?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keqing"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870614,
					"content": "Ah... You mean... Master and her friends?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ganyu"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870615,
					"content": "I see.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Ganyu"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4018707,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4018708
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4018708",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4018708,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Xianyun"
				],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							1145.934,
							349.309,
							1570.267
						],
						"pointId": 10625
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401870701,
					"content": "That young lass from the Wangsheng Funeral Parlor is rather impressive.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xianyun"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870702,
					"content": "One's curiosity was piqued when Rex Lapis chose to serve as her consultant. But only now does one understand the true intent behind his decision.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xianyun"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870703,
					"content": "Agreed. And yet, what a rare delight it is to hear such effusive praise from you, Cloud Retainer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Moon Carver"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870704,
					"content": "\"Rare\"? Pray elaborate a little further.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xianyun"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870705,
					"content": "In the past, you may have uttered something to the tune of this: \"Though the lass displays a measure of talent, it is nothing more than Shenhe or Ganyu could have achieved if placed in the same circumstances.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mountain Shaper"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870706,
					"content": "Hmph! One would never deride others as a means of praising one's own children. The Wangsheng lass displayed great determination and fortitude. Does that not make her deserving of a few words of praise?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xianyun"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870707,
					"content": "Hehehe, it certainly does. And she is not the first. I've lived in Liyue Harbor for a long time now, and I can tell you that the Wangsheng Funeral Parlor has produced generation upon generation of outstanding directors.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Madame Ping"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870708,
					"content": "Streetward Rambler speaks true. The god Tao Dou was not our friend, but neither was he our enemy. Had he not cared greatly for all living things, and volunteered to sanctify himself to pacify the underworld...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Moon Carver"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870709,
					"content": "Not even eight adepti would have been able to overpower him, much less the eight adepts. When he became the border, he likely never imagined that mortals would preserve and maintain his new form this far into the future...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Moon Carver"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870710,
					"content": "With all of that said, I realize the name of the young lady from the funeral parlor is still unknown to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mountain Shaper"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870711,
					"content": "The Director's surname is Hu, and her given name is Tao.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhongli"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870712,
					"content": "Hu... Ah! As in, our word for \"butterfly,\" yes?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Moon Carver"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870713,
					"content": "No, Hu as in \"mischief-maker.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhongli"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870714,
					"content": "Then \"Tao\" must likewise be the \"Tao\" that means mischief in our tongue?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Moon Carver"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870715,
					"content": "No, in fact, it is the same Tao as appears in \"Tao Dou.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhongli"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870716,
					"content": "Ah. So \"Hu\" as in butterfly, and \"Tao\" as in \"Tao Dou.\" A fine name. Fitting indeed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mountain Shaper"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870717,
					"content": "No, Hu as in \"mischief-maker,\" \"incessant pestering,\" and \"wonton gluttony\"!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xianyun"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870718,
					"content": "I say, I was merely trying to liven up the mood. Why is Hu Tao permitted to make mischief while I am not?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mountain Shaper"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870719,
					"content": "Hah! The clue is in the name. If you wish to change yours from Mountain Shaper to Mischief Maker, be my guest.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xianyun"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870720,
					"content": "Hehe, why not have some tea? This is the rare \"Spirit Sprout\" cultivar that Rex Lapis brought back all the way back from Qingce Village. It'd be a shame to miss out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Madame Ping"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870721,
					"content": "May there be more good tea to share in the coming year.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401870722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Madame Ping"
				},
				{
					"id": 401870722,
					"content": "I am sure there shall be.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Zhongli"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}